        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Defence is an idle-farming simulator with defence content. This game is designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while your farm is woking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/52644f30632509f1b93cc7e159f893d9.avif?t=1762484537\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◇Grow Crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, use your drone to automatically grow crops. Better crops will cost some money to seed, but will give more fuel to activate your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◇Produce Fuel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use crops to produce fuel to run your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/5c5c00c6db536d5a534f6863df057c5c.avif?t=1762484537\" width=1560 height=556 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◇Defend your Farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies will run to your town hall repetitively. Place turrets to defend your town hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don`t worry. There is no game over in this game. When your town hall is broken, all zombies will disappear and you can try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/81682b8de3614764efcfc9a20d3facc0.avif?t=1762484537\" width=1560 height=940 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Defence is an idle-farming simulator with defence content. This game is designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while your farm is woking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/52644f30632509f1b93cc7e159f893d9.avif?t=1762484537\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◇Grow Crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, use your drone to automatically grow crops. Better crops will cost some money to seed, but will give more fuel to activate your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◇Produce Fuel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use crops to produce fuel to run your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/5c5c00c6db536d5a534f6863df057c5c.avif?t=1762484537\" width=1560 height=556 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◇Defend your Farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies will run to your town hall repetitively. Place turrets to defend your town hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don`t worry. There is no game over in this game. When your town hall is broken, all zombies will disappear and you can try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/81682b8de3614764efcfc9a20d3facc0.avif?t=1762484537\" width=1560 height=940 /></span></p>",
